    "body": "@rexxars you can file an MDN issue now. In principle this is ready to land in the specification, but I'm a little worried that the browser patches don't seem to account for `EventSource` also having to go through this code path. We don't just want to safelist this header. We also want to make sure the existing use of this header abides by the safelist rules.\r\n\r\ncc @ricea ",
